[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4259996553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4259996553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4259996553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc796mOJ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T12:20:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T12:20:02Z","body":"CC @Chaosus","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4259996553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260033115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4260033115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4260033115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc796vJb","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T12:26:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T12:26:10Z","body":"Note: that's not an actual \"crash\" of the engine the preview just doesn't show up (since it enters to infinite loop):\n\n<img width=\"1018\" height=\"410\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0729de8e-807a-4868-8601-03f6c8c6fc30\" />\n\nThere are several ways to solve this issue - we may simply restrict setting a breakpoint inside the loop or add a counter to it to manually set up a required amount of iteration, or pass the loop completely after a breakpoint. What to choose is questionable.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260033115/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260038197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4260038197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4260038197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc796wY1","user":{"login":"cashew-olddew","id":155181921,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT_jYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155181921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew","html_url":"https://github.com/cashew-olddew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T12:26:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T12:26:56Z","body":"I discussed with @Chaosus and we thought it'd be a good idea to get some insights on how to go about this.\n\n## Possible solutions\n\n1. Simply do not allow breakpoints inside loops. Show an error message that they are not yet allowed. Fixes the crash.\n\n2. It would be reasonable enough to find the outer most loop a line is included in and, instead of removing everything after that line, one'd keep the whole loop.\n\n#### Code before\n```gdshader\n...\nfor(...) {\n  while(...) {\n    vec2 my_vec = vec2(1.0); <-- adding breakpoint here\n    vec3 something_else = vec3(1.0);\n  }\n}\n...\n\n```\n#### Code after adding the breakpoint \n```gdshader\n...\nfor(...) {\n  while(...) {\n    vec2 my_vec = vec2(1.0);\n    COLOR = vec4(my_vec, 0.0, 1.0); <-- this gets inserted\n    vec3 something_else = vec3(1.0);\n  }\n}\n<-- nothing here, all cut down until the fragment end\n```\n\nHowever, this comes with some caveats:\n- This will basically show the last value that variable will take (since COLOR gets overwritten after each iteration)\n- If the loop already contains a color assignment, there's a chance that the preview might not even work (since in this variant, nothing inside the loop is removed\n  - This could be avoided by removing any COLOR/ALBEDO assignments inside the loop, but that would come with extra overhead\n\nAn improvement idea for later would be to add a custom iterator to each loop so that you could preview a given step in the iteration. For example:\n```gdshader\nvec2 pea = vec2(0.0);\nbool iteration = 0;                   // Injected                 \nwhile(i < 5) {\n  var nut = vec2(i%10, 0.0);\n  if (iteration < _value_from_gui_) { // Injected\n    iteration += 1;                   // Injected\n    pea += nut;\n  }                                   // Injected\n  COLOR = vec4(nut, 0.0, 1.0);        // Injected                  \n}\n// Innocent variable and anything afterwards removed.\n```\nThe _value_from_gui_ could be manually modified from an incrementable text box. Maybe something like this?\n\n<img width=\"330\" height=\"344\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/289f4566-fb1d-458d-82f6-104eaf98f2c2\" />\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260038197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260111192","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4260111192","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4260111192,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc797CNY","user":{"login":"cashew-olddew","id":155181921,"node_id":"U_kgDOCT_jYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155181921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew","html_url":"https://github.com/cashew-olddew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cashew-olddew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T12:38:52Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T12:38:52Z","body":"The example I have initially provided was a simplified version of the code that caused the crash (I used that code based on the wrong assumption that the issue was 100% caused by this).\n\nThis is the code that broke the editor in my case. It is available in the MRP, but the example under _steps to reproduce_ is wrong.\n\n```gdscript\nvoid fragment() {\n  float x = 0.1;\n  while(x < UV.x) {\n    float temp = x + 0.1; <-- crashes here\n    x += 0.1;\n  }\n  ...\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260111192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260168857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4260168857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4260168857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc797QSZ","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T12:48:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T12:50:12Z","body":"Ah, yes, its permanently freezes the engine and crashing video driver, indeed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260168857/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260575236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4260575236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4260575236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc798zgE","user":{"login":"paddy-exe","id":38077837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDc3ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38077837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe","html_url":"https://github.com/paddy-exe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paddy-exe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T13:50:30Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T13:51:47Z","body":"> I discussed with [@Chaosus](https://github.com/Chaosus) and we thought it'd be a good idea to get some insights on how to go about this.\n> ## Possible solutions\n> \n>     1. Simply do not allow breakpoints inside loops. Show an error message that they are not yet allowed. Fixes the crash.\n> \n>     2. It would be reasonable enough to find the outer most loop a line is included in and, instead of removing everything after that line, one'd keep the whole loop.\n\nI would go for 1. first and then try to solve this with a custom iterator like you mentioned (after 4.7 released since this might require more UX team input). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4260575236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4268367140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118639#issuecomment-4268367140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118639","id":4268367140,"node_id":"IC_kw